# Syntax highlighting on GitHub / Gitea (github-linguist)
#
# Linguist cannot be taught the Axle language from inside a repo, so map .axle to
# Rust — the closest supported grammar (fn / let / mut / pub / dyn / trait /
# struct / enum / use / match / self / as / is and //, ///, /** */ comments all
# highlight; only `class` / `constructor` are missed). This colours .axle blobs
# on the crate's GitHub page.
#
# Flip `linguist-detectable=true` to false to keep .axle out of the language bar.
*.axle linguist-language=Rust linguist-detectable=true
